      "content": "\n## Issue\nFile list, profiles, and list in Chat.vue should use Collapsible components with truncation on header and expansion on detail view.\n\n## Requirements\n- File list should be collapsible (truncate on header, expand on detail)\n- Profiles section should be collapsible\n- List items in header should be truncated with expand/collapse functionality\n- Show full content when expanded\n\n## Files to Update\n- Chat.vue (primary component)\n- Review existing Collapsible component usage\n\n## Implementation Notes\n- Identify which sections need collapsible behavior\n- Define truncation rules (number of items, text length, etc.)\n- Ensure smooth expand/collapse animations\n- Maintain accessibility standards",
